==Description==
The '''Korblox Seeker''' was an enemy that exclusively appeared in [[The Hunt Event]]. It had a low amount of health and an average speed. On certain waves, it could be a hidden or lead enemy, or in some cases both. Additionally, it sometimes spawned with the stun and burn immunities.

==Appearance==
The '''Korblox Seeker''' had blue skin. It wore a black shirt, pants and hood. It had an arm-pad and knee-pad on its right arm and leg, with some blue neon spikes. It did not have a left arm and leg, exposing its skeleton.

==Strategy==
*The [[Pyromancer]] and [[Golden Pyromancer]] can be quite effective at clearing out hordes of '''Korblox Seekers''' early on.
**They can also be useful as the '''Korblox Seeker''' can spawn as a lead enemy, making them even more effective.
***Do note that on the tenth wave in hard mode, the '''Korblox Seeker''' is a burn immune lead enemy, making the [[Pyromancer]] and other burn tower less effective against it.
*Later on, the [[Minigunner]] and [[Accelerator]] can easily clear out hordes of these.
**They are also useful as the have both hidden detection and lead detection, making them able to deal damage to the '''Korblox Seeker''' on all waves.

